flowchart TD
    AGENT["1. Agent receives the message<br/>and conversation history"]
    MODEL["2. Model responds directly<br/>or requests a tool"]
    REQUEST{"Tool requested?"}
    DIRECT["5. Reply to patient<br/>No tool call; end this turn"]
    STATE{"State-changing tool?<br/>Reminder or adherence"}
    TOOL["3. Execute requested tool"]
    PAUSE["4. Graph pauses and asks<br/>patient to reply YES or NO"]
    CONFIRM{"Patient confirms?"}
    EXECUTE["Run approved reminder<br/>or adherence action"]
    CANCEL["Cancel action<br/>Do not write"]
    RESULT["Tool result is added<br/>to conversation history"]

    AGENT --> MODEL --> REQUEST
    REQUEST -->|No| DIRECT
    REQUEST -->|Yes| STATE
    STATE -->|No| TOOL --> RESULT
    STATE -->|Yes| PAUSE --> CONFIRM
    CONFIRM -->|YES| EXECUTE --> RESULT
    CONFIRM -->|NO| CANCEL --> RESULT
    RESULT -->|Loop back with tool result| AGENT

    linkStyle default stroke:#526579,stroke-width:1.7px
